UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Senior Technical Project Manager', descripcion=N'<h3>What you bring</h3><ul><li>6+ years of Project Management experience, including leading complex, cross-functional technology programs. </li><li>3+ years of Business Analysis experience. </li><li>Strong project management and organizational skills, with a track record of managing multiple concurrent initiatives.</li><li>Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to communicate technical concepts to non-technical audiences and executive leadership.</li><li>Proven ability to influence, negotiate, and collaborate across teams and senior leadership levels. </li><li>Strong analytical, problem-solving, and decision-making skills. </li><li>Ability to adapt quickly in a fast-paced and changing environment. </li><li>Experience managing technical professionals and cross-functional teams. </li><li>Ability to work independently with minimal supervision. </li><li>Strong attention to detail and ability to manage multiple priorities simultaneously. Experience assessing project risks and implementing mitigation strategies.</li><li>Demonstrated leadership, team-building, coaching, and mentoring skills. Proficiency with Microsoft Word, Excel, Project, PowerPoint, and Visio. Advanced, fluent business </li><li>English proficiency, written and spoken, for client-facing collaboration.</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><ul><li>Own end-to-end project management activities, including project planning, execution, monitoring, and delivery, across multiple concurrent initiatives. </li><li>Develop and manage project plans, timelines, milestones, budgets, and resource allocations for complex, cross-functional programs. </li><li>Partner with senior stakeholders to define business requirements, project scope, objectives, and success criteria.</li><li>Lead requirements elicitation, analysis, documentation, and validation processes to capture business and end-user needs. </li><li>Develop business process flows and workflow documentation. </li><li>Identify project dependencies, risks, and constraints, and design mitigation strategies. </li><li>Communicate project status, risks, and tradeoffs to stakeholders and executive leadership. </li><li>Coordinate daily with US-based leadership and stakeholders to align priorities, timelines, and delivery status across the full project lifecycle.</li><li>Guide delivery teams on project vision, priorities, and implementation plans. </li><li>Facilitate estimation, prioritization, and backlog management sessions. </li><li>Ensure projects are delivered on time, within scope, and within budget. Lead organizational change management and user adoption initiatives. </li><li>Drive process improvements and operational enhancements to increase productivity and efficiency.</li><li>Promote architectural standards, governance, and consistency across initiatives. </li><li>Provide consultative guidance and support throughout the project lifecycle. Work closely with development and technical teams to ensure business requirements are accurately translated into technical solutions</li><li>Analyze business processes to identify automation opportunities and assess technical feasibility. </li><li>Identify infrastructure and technical requirements needed to deploy automation solutions. </li><li>Coordinate with cross-functional teams to support implementation and integration activities.</li><li>Own issue resolution and remove project roadblocks in a timely manner.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>Comfortable with occasional in-person days in Viña del Mar and occasional international travel, depending on client needs. Valid travel documentation and entry eligibility for the United States.</li><li>Experience managing technology implementation or automation projects.</li><li>Knowledge of Flow Engineering.</li><li>PMP (Project Management Professional) Certification.</li><li>Bachelor''s degree in Business, Information Technology, Computer Science, or a related field.</li><li>Strong customer service mindset and stakeholder management skills.</li><li>Ability to think strategically while managing day-to-day execution.</li><li>Experience balancing technical and business priorities effectively.</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><ul><li>Ownership of end-to-end delivery for complex technology and automation programs, not a single-project role.</li><li>A central role connecting business stakeholders, technical teams, and senior leadership across a distributed, international delivery model.</li><li>High-impact role influencing project governance, delivery standards, and organizational change adoption.</li><li>Collaborative environment with the opportunity to mentor teams and shape delivery practice standards.</li><li>Growth path into senior program management, delivery leadership, or portfolio management roles.</li><li>Competitive salary.</li><li>Flexible work environment.</li><li>Opportunities for growth and certifications.</li><li>Inclusive and collaborative team culture.</li><li>Access to cutting-edge tools and technologies.</li></ul>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/senior-technical-project-manager-integratz-vina-del-mar' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
