UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Senior Forward Deployed AI Engineer (Anthropic)', descripcion=N'<h3>What We''re Looking For</h3><p><strong>Required Experience</strong></p><ul><li>3–5 years of experience in software engineering or data engineering, with extensive hands-on use of AI tools and LLM-based development over the past year (professional projects, internal initiatives, or substantial personal builds).</li><li>Professional English proficiency (C1/C2 minimum) — mandatory. You will work daily with international clients and colleagues.</li><li>Strong hands-on experience with the Anthropic ecosystem: Claude API, Claude Agent SDK or Claude Code, and MCP — ideally with experience taking at least one solution to production.</li><li>Strong programming skills in Python and TypeScript/JavaScript, and experience building and consuming APIs.</li><li>Experience with front-end development (React or similar) and at least one backend framework.</li><li>Hands-on experience with RAG, embeddings, and vector search, and with at least one agentic framework (Claude Agent SDK, LangGraph/LangChain).</li><li>Working experience with at least one cloud platform (GCP, AWS, or Azure); running Claude via Vertex AI or Amazon Bedrock is a plus.</li><li>Fluency with agentic coding tools such as Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Codex, or Cursor.</li><li>Experience building and maintaining data pipelines.</li><li>Bachelor''s or Master''s degree in computer science, engineering, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.</li></ul><p><strong>Certifications</strong></p><p>An Anthropic certification is a strong differentiator at application. If you do not hold one yet, obtaining it within your first 2 months in the role is a requirement — as a member of our team, Artefact will sponsor your exam and give you time to prepare.</p><ul><li>Claude Certified Developer – Foundations (Anthropic Certification Program), or a higher-level Claude Certified Architect credential.</li><li>Anthropic Academy completion certificates (Claude API, MCP, Claude Code) are valued as supporting evidence.</li></ul><p><strong>Preferred Experience</strong></p><ul><li>Experience with MCP servers, multi-agent patterns, or LLM evaluation tooling (LangSmith, Langfuse, promptfoo).</li><li>Experience with Terraform or CI/CD pipelines.</li><li>Contributions to the MCP ecosystem, published MCP servers, or open-source agentic tooling.</li></ul><p><strong>Key Capabilities</strong></p><p>A strong candidate will bring:</p><ul><li>Deep expertise in the Anthropic platform, combined with breadth across the full stack</li><li>Owns features end to end, from interface to infrastructure</li><li>Cares about evaluation and reliability, not just the happy path</li><li>Communicates clearly with clients in demos, documents, and code review</li><li>Client-facing mindset: understands client needs and translates business requirements into technical solutions</li><li>Learns new tools and models fast, and shares what works</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><p>Our team is looking for Senior Deployed AI Engineers specialized in the Anthropic (Claude) ecosystem: embedded with clients, taking AI products from idea to production.</p><p> In this role, you''ll design and build the interfaces, services, and agentic systems at the heart of our work: conversational apps, agents automating workflows, and the pipelines supporting them. You own components end to end: front end, service, data, deployment, evals.</p><p><strong>Build Full-Stack AI Applications, End to End</strong></p><ul><li>Develop interfaces in TypeScript/React and backend services/APIs in Python or Node.</li><li>Implement agentic behavior: orchestration, tool/function calling, memory, guardrails.</li><li>Build RAG pipelines: ingestion, chunking, embeddings, vector/hybrid search.</li><li>Connect AI systems to enterprise data via APIs, semantic layers, and MCP.</li></ul><p><strong>Go Deep on the Anthropic Platform</strong></p><ul><li>Build agentic systems with the Claude API and Agent SDK: tool use, extended thinking, prompt caching, citations.</li><li>Deploy cloud-hosted agents with Claude Managed Agents: sandboxed execution, memory, checkpointing, orchestration, tracing.</li><li>Build MCP servers/clients connecting Claude to enterprise systems.</li><li>Make Claude Code core to delivery — skills, subagents, hooks.</li><li>Deploy Claude via the API, Vertex AI, or Bedrock, choosing Opus/Sonnet/Haiku per trade-off.</li><li>Track Anthropic''s releases and translate capabilities into value.</li></ul><p><strong>Make AI Systems Production-Grade</strong></p><ul><li>Write evals and regression tests; monitor cost, latency, quality.</li><li>Apply solid practice: version control, review, testing, CI/CD, observability.</li><li>Deploy on GCP/Azure/AWS using containers, serverless, infra-as-code.</li><li>Build and maintain data pipelines feeding AI systems.</li></ul><p><strong>Work AI-Natively and Client-Facing</strong></p><ul><li>Use agentic coding tools (Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Codex, Cursor) daily, with good judgment.</li><li>Communicate progress, trade-offs, and blockers to clients and leads.</li><li>Support pre-sales: scope solutions, build demos, estimate effort.</li><li>Mentor engineers; contribute to accelerators and standards.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><div>Experience with MCP servers, multi-agent patterns, or LLM evaluation tooling (LangSmith, Langfuse, promptfoo). Experience with Terraform or CI/CD pipelines. Contributions to the MCP ecosystem, published MCP servers, or open-source agentic tooling.</div><h3>Beneficios</h3><div>At Artefact, data and AI are not abstract strategy topics. They are tools for creating business value, improving organizations, and helping people make better decisions.</div><div>You will join a global community of data and AI experts who combine consulting, engineering, data science, marketing, and technology expertise. You will work on complex, high-impact problems with leading organizations and help shape how enterprises adopt AI responsibly and effectively.</div><div>We value action, collaboration, learning, client trust, and shared knowledge. We believe that technology only matters when it is used, adopted, and translated into impact.</div>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/senior-deployed-ai-engineer-anthropic-artefact-us-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
