UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Senior Software Engineer – Serverless Workflow', descripcion=N'<h3>Qualifications:</h3><p>Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field. Advanced degrees are a plus. 6 to 8 years of professional experience in software development, with a strong focus on .NET technologies. Proven experience in building and managing serverless workflows and cloud-native applications.</p><p>Accountable use of AI-assisted tools</p><p>Hands-on experience with AWS services such as Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB, and related serverless tools. Proficiency in .NET 8/10 and developing RESTful services using WebAPI. Familiarity with Document Intelligence technologies and their integration into enterprise solutions. Strong problem-solving skills, attention to detail, and the ability to work effectively in a collaborative environment.</p><h3>Funciones</h3><p>Design, develop, and maintain scalable serverless workflows using best practices to optimize performance and cost-efficiency. Architect and implement backend services using .NET 8/10 and WebAPI frameworks. Collaborate with cross-functional teams to integrate Document Intelligence solutions that enhance data processing and automation. Develop and deploy cloud-native applications on AWS, ensuring high availability, security, and scalability. Lead code reviews, mentor junior engineers, and contribute to continuous improvement of development processes. Troubleshoot, debug, and optimize existing applications to improve reliability and performance. Stay updated with the latest industry trends and technologies to recommend and implement innovative solutions.</p><h3>Deseable</h3><p>Relevant certifications in AWS or .NET technologies are advantageous.</p><h3>Beneficios</h3>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/senior-software-engineer-serverless-workflow-hyqoo-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
