UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Senior AI Native Full-Stack Software Engineer', descripcion=N'<h3>Required Qualifications</h3><ul><li>At least 3 years of professional software development experience, or equivalent demonstrated expertise.</li><li>Proven experience independently delivering production software.</li><li>Strong proficiency in JavaScript/TypeScript and at least one modern backend development environment.</li><li>Experience with React, Next.js, Node.js, or comparable frameworks.</li><li>Experience designing and working with relational databases, such as PostgreSQL.</li><li>Experience building and consuming REST APIs.</li><li>Hands-on experience deploying applications to AWS, Google Cloud, Vercel, or similar environments.</li><li>Strong understanding of application security, authentication, authorization, and data protection.</li><li>Experience with Git, automated testing, CI/CD, and production debugging.</li><li>Experience using AI coding tools in real development workflows.</li><li>Ability to communicate clearly in English.</li><li>Ability to work independently, manage priorities, and take responsibility for completed deliverables.</li><li>Ability to work with Codex, Claude Code, and more.</li></ul><h2>What We''re Looking For</h2><p>We want someone who:</p><ul><li>Takes ownership rather than waiting for detailed instructions.</li><li>Enjoys building useful products and solving business problems.</li><li>Uses AI to become more productive without sacrificing engineering quality.</li><li>Understands the difference between a working prototype and reliable production software.</li><li>Communicates proactively when encountering obstacles.</li><li>Can explain technical decisions to nontechnical business leaders.</li><li>Values clean architecture, security, testing, and long-term maintainability.</li></ul><p><strong>We are not looking for someone who only knows how to generate applications through prompts without understanding the underlying code.</strong></p><p>We want an experienced engineer who uses AI as a powerful development tool.</p><h3>Funciones</h3><ul><li>Independently architect, develop, test, and deploy full-stack applications.</li><li>Build reliable backend services, APIs, and database integrations.</li><li>Develop responsive web interfaces and dashboards.</li><li>Work with applications hosted on Vercel, AWS, Google Cloud, or comparable platforms.</li><li>Use AI coding tools to accelerate development while maintaining high engineering standards.</li><li>Review, debug, and improve AI-generated code.</li><li>Implement secure authentication, authorization, and data-access controls.</li><li>Write automated tests and establish reliable deployment processes.</li><li>Monitor application performance and troubleshoot production issues.</li><li>Document technical architecture and development decisions.</li><li>Collaborate with our COO to translate business requirements into technical solutions.</li><li>Identify technical risks and recommend practical solutions.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>Experience integrating large language models or AI APIs into production applications.</li><li>Experience building SaaS products or multi-tenant applications.</li><li>Experience with learning management systems, educational technology, or CRM platforms.</li><li>Experience with automation platforms such as n8n, Make, or Zapier.</li><li>Experience with serverless architecture and cloud infrastructure.</li><li>Experience with Claude Code, Codex, and more models</li><li>Familiarity with Python.</li><li>Experience improving or maintaining applications originally developed using AI-assisted coding.</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><ul><li>$4,000+ USD per month, depending on experience.</li><li>Long-term remote opportunity.</li><li>Flexible working arrangements.</li><li>Direct collaboration with company leadership.</li><li>Significant ownership of technical projects.</li><li>Opportunities to build AI-powered educational technology used by thousands of students.</li><li>The ability to influence our technical architecture and future product development.</li></ul>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/senior-ai-native-full-stack-software-engineer-justinsurance-llc-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
