UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'AI Infrastructure Platform Engineer', descripcion=N'<h3>Experience and Skills</h3><ul><li>Senior-level experience with 5+ years in infrastructure, platform engineering, DevOps, or SRE.</li><li>C1 English level or higher.</li><li>Production experience with AWS and Azure, including networking, IAM, compute, storage, and security.</li><li>Strong Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, CI/CD, Linux, Bash, LLM tooling, and networking experience.</li><li>Experience administering infrastructure through CLI-first workflows and operating production platforms safely.</li><li>Hands-on experience with Active Directory, Microsoft Entra ID, Windows Server, Python, PowerShell, Ansible, Disaster Recovery, Backup, RBAC, DNS, VPN, PKI, AWS Landing Zones, Azure Landing Zones, Observability, Secrets Management, Incident Response, Solid, Claude.</li></ul><h3>Skills</h3><ul><li>Kubernetes</li><li>Terraform</li><li>AWS</li><li>Azure</li><li>Linux</li><li>Bash</li><li>Docker</li><li>CI/CD</li><li>LLM Tooling</li><li>Networking</li><li>Active Directory</li><li>Microsoft Entra ID</li><li>Windows Server</li><li>Python</li><li>PowerShell</li><li>Ansible</li><li>Disaster Recovery</li><li>Backup</li><li>IAM</li><li>RBAC</li><li>DNS</li><li>VPN</li><li>PKI</li><li>AWS Landing Zones</li><li>Azure Landing Zones</li><li>Observability</li><li>Secrets Management</li><li>Incident Response</li><li>Solid</li><li>LLM</li><li>Claude</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><ul><li>Own platform components end to end, including Terraform modules, Kubernetes capabilities, cloud patterns, CI/CD templates, and provisioning workflows.</li><li>Design, build, and operate AWS and Azure environments, including landing zones, hybrid networking, IAM, compute, storage, migrations, and cost optimization.</li><li>Manage hybrid identity and server estates across Active Directory, Microsoft Entra ID, Windows Server, Linux, and virtualization platforms.</li><li>Design and operate backup and disaster recovery capabilities, including immutable copies, restore testing, recovery objectives, disaster recovery exercises, and audit evidence.</li><li>Build secure self-service infrastructure workflows, APIs, CLIs, and agent-accessible interfaces for provisioning servers, accounts, network access, and backups.</li><li>Implement observability, guardrails, secrets hygiene, least-privilege access, audit trails, drift detection, and automated validation.</li><li>Troubleshoot cloud, server, network, identity, storage, and Kubernetes issues. Participate in incident response, on-call support, and blameless post-incident reviews.</li><li>Document architecture, runbooks, disaster recovery plans, and operational procedures for human engineers and AI agents.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>GitOps</li><li>ArgoCD</li><li>FluxCD</li><li>Helm</li><li>OPA</li><li>Conftest</li><li>API Design</li><li>MCP Integration</li><li>Observability</li><li>Bicep</li><li>ARM Templates</li><li>Packer</li><li>Azure Policy</li><li>AWS Config</li><li>Policy as Code</li><li>EKS</li><li>AKS</li><li>Internal Developer Tools</li><li>OpenTelemetry</li><li>CKA</li><li>CKAD</li><li>Terraform Associate</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><p>We provide the opportunity to participate in impactful and technically rigorous industrial data projects that drive innovation and professional growth. Our work environment emphasizes technical excellence, collaboration, and continuous innovation.</p><p>Niuro supports a 100% remote work model, allowing flexibility in work location globally. We invest in career development through ongoing training programs and leadership opportunities, ensuring continuous growth and success.</p><p>Upon successful completion of the initial contract, there is potential for long-term collaboration and stable, full-time employment, reflecting our long-term commitment to our team members.</p><p>Joining Niuro means becoming part of a global community dedicated to technological excellence and benefiting from a strong administrative support infrastructure that enables you to focus on impactful work without distraction.</p>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/ai-infrastructure-platform-engineer-niuro-remote-e893' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
