UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Cybersecurity Engineer', descripcion=N'<h3>Experience and Skills</h3><ul><li>Senior cybersecurity professional with at least 3 years of experience in cybersecurity, security operations, information security, or a closely related field.</li><li>Hands-on experience with security monitoring, alert analysis, incident response, escalation, and mitigation.</li><li>Experience managing vulnerabilities, coordinating remediation, and addressing penetration testing findings.</li><li>Strong understanding of cloud security principles and practical experience with AWS environments.</li><li>Knowledge of identity and access management, endpoint security, network security, and application security.</li><li>Experience with SIEM, EDR, WAF, vulnerability scanning, and cloud security solutions.</li><li>Familiarity with ISO 27001 technical controls and experience gathering and presenting audit evidence.</li><li>Experience managing cybersecurity vendors or external security service providers.</li><li>Strong documentation, organization, follow-up, and project management skills.</li><li>Ability to communicate technical risks clearly to technical and non-technical stakeholders.</li><li>Ability to work independently while managing multiple security projects and initiatives.</li><li>Professional English communication skills, written and verbal.</li><li>Hands-on experience with Vulnerability Management, Vendor Management.</li></ul><h3>Skills</h3><ul><li>Security Operations</li><li>Security Monitoring</li><li>Incident Response</li><li>Vulnerability Management</li><li>Penetration Testing</li><li>AWS</li><li>Cloud Security</li><li>Identity and Access Management</li><li>Endpoint Security</li><li>Network Security</li><li>Application Security</li><li>SIEM</li><li>EDR</li><li>WAF</li><li>Vulnerability Scanning</li><li>ISO 27001</li><li>Audit Evidence</li><li>Vendor Management</li><li>testing</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><ul><li>Monitor and analyze security alerts to identify, investigate, and escalate potential threats.</li><li>Support incident response activities by coordinating actions across teams and implementing timely containment and mitigation measures.</li><li>Manage vulnerability assessment programs, remediation planning, ownership tracking, and follow-up.</li><li>Coordinate penetration testing activities and track remediation of identified vulnerabilities.</li><li>Maintain, review, and optimize SIEM, EDR, WAF, vulnerability scanning, and cloud security tools.</li><li>Implement and continuously improve technical controls aligned with ISO 27001.</li><li>Gather, organize, and present security and audit evidence.</li><li>Manage relationships with cybersecurity vendors and external service providers.</li><li>Partner with Engineering, DevOps, IT, Risk, Compliance, and Legal to integrate security best practices into operational processes.</li><li>Document security activities, risks, decisions, remediation status, and control effectiveness.</li><li>Track multiple security initiatives and provide proactive status updates to relevant stakeholders.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>AWS Security Services</li><li>Security Tool Optimization</li><li>Security Frameworks</li><li>Penetration Testing Coordination</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><p>We provide the opportunity to participate in impactful and technically rigorous industrial data projects that drive innovation and professional growth. Our work environment emphasizes technical excellence, collaboration, and continuous innovation.</p><p>Niuro supports a 100% remote work model, allowing flexibility in work location globally. We invest in career development through ongoing training programs and leadership opportunities, ensuring continuous growth and success.</p><p>Upon successful completion of the initial contract, there is potential for long-term collaboration and stable, full-time employment, reflecting our long-term commitment to our team members.</p><p>Joining Niuro means becoming part of a global community dedicated to technological excellence and benefiting from a strong administrative support infrastructure that enables you to focus on impactful work without distraction.</p>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/cybersecurity-engineer-niuro-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
