UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'QA Automation Engineer (Azure)', descripcion=N'<h3>What we’re looking for</h3><p>We’re looking for a QA Automation Engineer with hands-on experience delivering automated testing at the functional, integration, or API level.</p><ul><li><strong>Experience:</strong> 2–4 years of experience in automated software testing (functional, integration, or API level).</li><li><strong>Automation &amp; languages:</strong> Working knowledge of <strong>C#/.NET</strong> and a testing framework such as <strong>Playwright</strong>, <strong>Selenium</strong>, <strong>NUnit</strong>, <strong>xUnit</strong>, <strong>MSTest</strong>, or <strong>SpecFlow</strong>.</li><li><strong>Data validation:</strong> Basic skills with <strong>SQL Server</strong> queries and validating expected data outcomes.</li><li><strong>Version control &amp; pipelines:</strong> Familiarity with <strong>Git</strong> and <strong>CI/CD</strong> pipelines (including automated execution and monitoring).</li><li><strong>Domain exposure:</strong> Experience with logistics, warehouse, receiving, or supply-chain systems is a plus.</li><li><strong>Application types:</strong> Exposure to configuration-driven or multi-tenant applications is a plus.</li></ul><p><strong>Soft skills we value:</strong> clear communication, strong attention to detail, accountability for keeping automated suites reliable, and a collaborative mindset when investigating failures. We also value curiosity and structured troubleshooting—especially when distinguishing defects from flaky tests or environment issues.</p><p>If you enjoy turning business workflows into dependable automation and want to contribute to continuous quality in a CI/CD environment, we’d like to meet you.</p><h3>Funciones</h3><p>We help keep Managed Receiving releases safe and predictable by building and maintaining automated tests across multiple layers:</p><ul><li>Build automated functional, integration, and API-level tests for Managed Receiving regression scenarios, as assigned by senior engineers.</li><li>Execute test cases against identified business workflows and configuration-driven scenarios.</li><li>Maintain existing test frameworks and test data sets so regressions remain accurate and reusable.</li><li>Run and monitor automated tests within the <strong>Azure DevOps</strong> CI/CD pipeline.</li><li>Flag failing tests and support triage to determine whether issues come from a real defect, flaky automation, or an environment/configuration problem.</li><li>Collaborate with engineers and stakeholders to improve test coverage and reliability over time.</li></ul><p>We expect you to take ownership of your assigned regression coverage while continuously improving automation stability and signal quality.</p><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>Experience writing and maintaining test data for integration/regression suites.</li><li>Deeper familiarity with logistics/warehouse receiving concepts and how configuration changes affect system behavior.</li><li>Prior work with Azure DevOps pipelines for automated test execution, reporting, and troubleshooting.</li><li>Experience improving test stability (e.g., reducing flakiness) and strengthening diagnostics for faster triage.</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><ul><li>Contrato a largo plazo.</li><li>100% Remoto.</li><li>Vacaciones y PTOs</li><li>Posibilidad de recibir 2 bonos al año.</li><li>2 revisiones salariales al año.</li><li>Clases de inglés.</li><li>Equipamiento Apple.</li><li>Plataforma de cursos en linea</li><li>Budget para compra de libros.</li><li>Budget para compra de materiales de trabajo</li><li>mucho mas..</li></ul>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/qa-automation-engineer-azure-improving-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
