UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'SEO & AI Search Manager', descripcion=N'<h3>What We''re Looking For</h3><div><strong>Core Skills</strong></div><ul><li>4+ years in SEO with measurable wins you can walk us through</li><li>Strong technical SEO fundamentals: site architecture, indexing, structured data, Core Web Vitals</li><li>Experience with programmatic SEO or content at scale</li><li>Real AI-search work you can show us: content that earned citations, experiments you ran, visibility you moved</li><li>Fluent with the standard stack: Semrush or Ahrefs, Search Console, GA4 or Amplitude, WordPress</li></ul><div><strong>Mindset</strong></div><ul><li>Ownership-driven: you treat the channel like it''s your business</li><li>Experimental: AI search has no playbook yet, and that excites you</li><li>Pragmatic with data: you ship, measure, and iterate</li><li>Strong communicator who can explain what''s working and why</li><li>Don''t tick every box? If the core skills fit and you''ve done real work in this space, apply anyway. We care more about what you''ve shipped than a perfect checklist.</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><div><strong>Own Organic Growth</strong></div><div>Own SEO strategy and execution end to end: technical, content, and off-page</div><div>Grow 150k monthly organic visits into a compounding acquisition channel that drives signups and revenue</div><div>Build and own the measurement framework and its live dashboard: rankings, AI citations, share of voice, and organic signups. This becomes how the whole company sees the channel</div><div><strong>Win AI Search</strong></div><div>Grow our visibility across ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, and AI Overviews through entity coverage, structured data, answer-level content, and everything LLMs read about us</div><div>Track how AI models cite and recommend us, with tools like Profound or Peec, or by building our own (we have the engineering support to do it)</div><div>Run our digital PR motion: reviews, roundups, and data studies that earn the citations LLMs trust</div><div>Work with a rare advantage: our data already powers AI workflows through our API and MCP integrations, so you''re marketing a product AI assistants actually use</div><div><strong>Scale Programmatic SEO</strong></div><div>Run and expand our programmatic page engine: hundreds of pages across niches, geographies, and rankings</div><div>Launch and promote free tools built to earn links, mentions, and traffic</div><div>Turn our proprietary creator data into content and studies nobody else can publish</div><div><strong>Work Across Teams</strong></div><ul><li>Partner closely with growth and engineering to ship fast</li><li>Use AI tools and agents daily. We build with them, and expect you to as well</li><li>Bring the outside in: what''s changing in search, and what we should do about it</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>B2B SaaS background, ideally data products or APIs</li><li>Digital PR and link-earning experience</li><li>Basic HTML/CSS and enough technical comfort to work directly with engineers</li><li>Experience building workflows with AI tools and agents</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><ul><li>A running start: 150k+ monthly visits, a live programmatic engine, and free tools already earning links</li><li>A data moat: proprietary creator data means you can publish studies and pages competitors simply can''t</li><li>Full channel ownership: your strategy, your roadmap, your results</li><li>The frontier of search: own AI/LLM visibility at a company whose product is built for the AI era</li><li>An AI-forward team: modern tools and workflows are the default here</li><li>Flexible remote setup built around trust and autonomy</li><li>Fast growth opportunities inside a scaling startup</li></ul>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/seo-ai-search-manager-influencers-club-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
