UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Platform Engineering Lead', descripcion=N'<h3>Experience and Skills</h3><ul><li>Lead-level experience with 6+ years in software engineering, including significant ownership of production software architecture.</li><li>C1 English level or higher.</li><li>Strong full-stack engineering proficiency with technologies such as TypeScript, Python, React, APIs, and cloud infrastructure.</li><li>Demonstrated experience designing ontologies, knowledge graphs, semantic layers, or object-based enterprise data models.</li><li>Proven track record taking software from early prototype through production deployment in distributed cloud environments.</li><li>Strong background in enterprise security, access controls such as RBAC and ABAC, data isolation, encryption, and compliance frameworks.</li><li>Demonstrated experience mentoring or leading engineers alongside direct collaboration with business stakeholders.</li><li>Ability to travel internationally as required.</li><li>Hands-on experience with Cloud Architecture, Data Modeling, Distributed Systems, API Design, Relational Databases, large language models.</li></ul><h3>Skills</h3><ul><li>TypeScript</li><li>Python</li><li>React</li><li>Cloud Architecture</li><li>Data Modeling</li><li>Distributed Systems</li><li>Ontologies</li><li>API Design</li><li>Enterprise Security</li><li>Relational Databases</li><li>large language models</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><ul><li>Architect and develop the core technology platform, including a unified data layer connecting databases, APIs, documents, and real-time feeds.</li><li>Develop semantic layers and ontologies to model business objects, relationships, operational workflows, and permissions.</li><li>Build infrastructure enabling AI agents to securely access context, invoke tools, and execute workflows in production.</li><li>Lead and mentor a team of Forward Deployed Engineers, establishing development standards, review processes, and engineering practices.</li><li>Partner directly with operational stakeholders to translate complex business problems into robust software applications and data models.</li><li>Convert custom customer-specific solutions into reusable platform capabilities and repeatable deployment patterns.</li><li>Implement enterprise-grade security, identity management, data isolation, audit logging, and compliance controls across the platform.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>Large Language Models</li><li>AI Agents</li><li>Vector Databases</li><li>Event-Driven Architecture</li><li>ERP Integration</li><li>CRM Integration</li><li>Workflow Automation</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><p>We provide the opportunity to participate in impactful and technically rigorous industrial data projects that drive innovation and professional growth. Our work environment emphasizes technical excellence, collaboration, and continuous innovation.</p><p>Niuro supports a 100% remote work model, allowing flexibility in work location globally. We invest in career development through ongoing training programs and leadership opportunities, ensuring continuous growth and success.</p><p>Upon successful completion of the initial contract, there is potential for long-term collaboration and stable, full-time employment, reflecting our long-term commitment to our team members.</p><p>Joining Niuro means becoming part of a global community dedicated to technological excellence and benefiting from a strong administrative support infrastructure that enables you to focus on impactful work without distraction.</p>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/platform-engineering-lead-niuro-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
