UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Senior Full-Stack Software Developer', descripcion=N'<h3>REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS</h3><ul><li>10+ years of professional software development experience</li><li>Expert-level backend development experience</li><li>Extensive professional experience with PHP</li><li>Strong experience with Symfony or comparable enterprise PHP frameworks</li><li>Proven experience designing the architecture of complex production applications</li><li>Strong understanding of object-oriented programming, design patterns, and software architecture</li><li>Advanced SQL and relational database experience</li><li>Experience designing, building, documenting, and maintaining RESTful APIs</li><li>Strong understanding of application security, performance, scalability, and reliability</li><li>Experience debugging difficult issues across large, interconnected systems</li><li>Solid professional experience with JavaScript and TypeScript</li><li>Working knowledge of React and Next.js</li><li>Experience with Git, code reviews, testing, deployment, and modern development workflows</li><li>Experience successfully taking ownership of major projects from planning through production</li><li>Ability to evaluate an existing system and improve it without unnecessarily rebuilding everything</li><li>A consistent history of delivering stable, maintainable, production-quality software</li></ul><p>This position requires strong conversational English.</p><p>You do not need to speak perfect English, but you must be able to communicate clearly and efficiently during live video calls with our US-based leadership and engineering teams. You must be comfortable discussing technical problems, asking questions, explaining your decisions, providing updates, and raising concerns before they become larger issues.</p><p>Written communication alone is not sufficient for this role.</p><ul><li>You are a genuinely senior engineer who can solve difficult problems independently</li><li>Backend architecture and complex business logic are among your strongest skills</li><li>You can examine unfamiliar code, understand it quickly, and make responsible improvements</li><li>You think beyond whether the code works and consider security, scalability, maintainability, and business impact</li><li>You communicate proactively and do not disappear when a problem becomes difficult</li><li>You ask thoughtful questions before making major technical decisions</li><li>You accept feedback professionally and can respectfully challenge ideas when you see a better solution</li><li>You deliver what you commit to and communicate early when priorities or timelines need to change</li><li>You are comfortable being accountable for important production systems</li><li>You maintain a high standard for your own work without requiring constant supervision</li><li>Delivering reliable, production-quality software that solves meaningful business problems</li><li>Becoming a trusted technical leader within the engineering team</li><li>Improving the stability, performance, security, and scalability of our platform</li><li>Making our existing codebase easier and safer to maintain</li><li>Reducing technical debt while continuing to deliver valuable new products</li><li>Helping other developers make better technical decisions</li><li>Communicating clearly with both technical and non-technical leadership</li><li>Taking ownership of challenging projects and carrying them through completion</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><ul><li>Design, build, and maintain complex backend systems using PHP and Symfony</li><li>Make sound architectural decisions that support scalability, reliability, security, and long-term maintainability</li><li>Develop APIs, integrations, background processes, automation workflows, and complex business logic</li><li>Work within a large existing codebase and quickly understand how interconnected systems operate</li><li>Modernize legacy applications without disrupting critical business operations</li><li>Diagnose and resolve difficult performance, data, infrastructure, and application issues</li><li>Design and optimize relational databases, queries, and data structures</li><li>Integrate third-party platforms, APIs, AI models, and automation tools</li><li>Contribute to frontend applications built with React, Next.js, JavaScript, and TypeScript</li><li>Take ownership of projects from technical planning through deployment and ongoing support</li><li>Review code and help establish strong engineering standards</li><li>Mentor other developers and provide technical leadership when needed</li><li>Collaborate directly with leadership, product stakeholders, and other engineers</li><li>Clearly explain technical problems, recommendations, timelines, and tradeoffs</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>AWS or other cloud infrastructure experience</li><li>Experience integrating AI models or LLMs into production applications</li><li>Experience with custom CMS or CRM platforms</li><li>Experience modernizing large legacy systems</li><li>CI/CD pipeline and production deployment experience</li><li>Docker and containerized development environments</li><li>Elasticsearch, OpenSearch, or other search technologies</li><li>Background jobs, queues, caching, and event-driven systems</li><li>Automated testing and quality assurance practices</li><li>Experience leading technical projects or mentoring engineers</li><li>Experience working on a small, senior team where individual ownership matters</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/senior-full-stack-software-developer-one-click-technology-llc-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
