UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Senior Mobile & Full-Stack Engineer (.NET Maui / iOS / Java)', descripcion=N'<h3>Overall responsibilities</h3><h4>SMobile Application Development &amp; Modernization</h4><ul><li>Develop, maintain, and enhance enterprise iOS applications using C#, .NET MAUI, and Xamarin.iOS.</li><li>Participate in Xamarin-to-.NET MAUI migration initiatives.</li><li>Design, develop, and support native iOS camera and barcode scanning functionality.</li><li>Perform device compatibility testing and iOS version upgrade validation.</li><li>Conduct regression testing and impact analysis for application, service, and data changes.</li></ul><h3>Application Release Management</h3><ul><li>Manage mobile application releases through enterprise distribution platforms and TestFlight.</li><li>Configure and support VMware AirWatch (Workspace ONE UEM) deployments.</li><li>Maintain Apple provisioning profiles, distribution certificates, and application signing processes.</li><li>Coordinate production releases and deployment activities.</li></ul><h3>Backend Services Support</h3><ul><li>Support and maintain Java-based backend systems running on IBM WebSphere Application Server.</li><li>Troubleshoot and enhance REST and SOAP services.</li><li>Analyze and resolve application integration issues.</li><li>Work with legacy Java applications and web technologies when required.</li></ul><h3>Production Support &amp; Maintenance</h3><ul><li>Investigate and resolve production incidents.</li><li>Monitor application performance using DynaTrace or similar APM tools.</li><li>Participate in incident, problem, and change management processes.</li><li>Support continuous improvement and operational stability across mobile and backend applications.</li></ul><h3>Database &amp; Data Support</h3><ul><li>Create and troubleshoot SQL queries.</li><li>Support DB2, Oracle, SQL Server, and SQLite data environments.</li><li>Investigate data integrity and performance issues.</li><li>Assist with troubleshooting data flows connected to enterprise and mainframe systems.</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><p> Backend development in Java, including enterprise services on application servers such as WebSphere</p><p>- Relational databases, including advanced SQL on DB2 and Oracle</p><p>- API integration with REST and SOAP services, including tracing and troubleshooting</p><p>- Legacy code maintenance: reading, refactoring, and modernizing established Java codebases</p><p>- Frontend development with Angular and familiarity with Linux-based environments</p><p>- Production troubleshooting using APM tools such as Dynatrace, along with log analysis</p><p>- Incident and change management in ITSM platforms</p><p>- Cross-platform and mobile development with C# and .NET MAUI, with native iOS experience (nice to have)</p><p>- Application release management for mobile apps, including enterprise distribution and TestFlight</p><p>- Regression testing and impact analysis for service and data changes.</p><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li> 5+ years of software engineering experience with mobile and backend applications.</li><li>3+ years of iOS development experience using Xcode and the iOS SDK.</li><li>Hands-on experience with C#, .NET, and Xamarin/.NET MAUI.</li><li>Strong experience supporting and troubleshooting Java applications and REST/SOAP services.</li><li>Experience with IBM WebSphere and legacy enterprise environments.</li><li>Working knowledge of SQL and database troubleshooting (DB2, Oracle, or SQL Server).</li><li>Experience with enterprise mobile application deployment, including AirWatch/Workspace ONE, Apple certificates, provisioning profiles, and TestFlight.</li><li>Experience migrating Xamarin applications to .NET MAUI.</li><li>Experience implementing native iOS barcode scanning using AVFoundation, Vision, or VisionKit.</li><li>Experience replacing third-party mobile SDKs such as Scandit.</li><li>Familiarity with Angular, Vaadin, JSP, Struts, or SUSE Linux environments.</li><li>Experience working in large enterprise environments supporting mission-critical applications</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><ul><li>Contrato a largo plazo.</li><li>100% Remoto.</li><li>Vacaciones y PTOs</li><li>Posibilidad de recibir 2 bonos al año.</li><li>2 revisiones salariales al año.</li><li>Clases de inglés.</li><li>Equipamiento Apple.</li><li>Plataforma de cursos en linea</li><li>Budget para compra de libros.</li><li>Budget para compra de materiales de trabajo</li><li>mucho mas..</li></ul>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/senior-mobile-full-stack-engineer-net-maui-ios-java-improving-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
