UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Senior Data Engineer, Redshift Expert', descripcion=N'<h3>You bring:</h3><ul><li>- 5+ years of data engineering experience with deep production expertise in Amazon Redshift or Redshift Serverless.</li><li>- Advanced SQL and demonstrated query tuning on large datasets.</li><li>- Hands-on experience with S3, Glue, Lambda, IAM, and Redshift Spectrum.</li><li>- Experience with Airflow, dbt, Glue, or similar ETL/ELT tools.</li><li>- C1 English and the ability to work independently with stakeholders.</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><ul><li>- Review the current Redshift setup and identify performance, cost, reliability, and design issues.</li><li>- Tune distribution keys, sort keys, compression, queries, and Workload Management.</li><li>- Build and maintain ETL/ELT pipelines using Redshift and the AWS data stack.</li><li>- Improve analytics-ready data models and document the changes and operating practices.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>Python, dbt, product analytics data pipelines, and experience in fintech or another regulated industry. These qualifications are optional.</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><p>Contract: 1 to 2 weeks, full-time. Remote in LATAM, excluding Argentina and Brazil, with overlap with U.S. Eastern Time. Compensation starts at USD 25 per hour.</p>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/senior-data-engineer-redshift-expert-niuro-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
