UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'GTM Engineer', descripcion=N'<h3>Experience and Skills</h3><ul><li>At least 5 years of experience building and operating GTM, growth, revenue, or commercial automation systems.</li><li>Demonstrated ownership of GTM systems, including measurable commercial results, troubleshooting, and system improvements.</li><li>Hands-on experience with Python or JavaScript, SQL, APIs, and webhooks.</li><li>Experience using Git and automated or repeatable testing practices.</li><li>Practical experience integrating LLMs into production or operational workflows.</li><li>Ability to evaluate AI output quality, cost, speed, failure modes, and appropriate human review points.</li><li>Experience designing and running commercial experiments with clear hypotheses, audiences, budgets, success metrics, and review dates.</li><li>Strong commercial judgment regarding customer relevance, opportunity quality, and outreach effectiveness.</li><li>Ability to build, maintain, monitor, and troubleshoot integrations and automated workflows.</li><li>Confident written and verbal communication in English.</li><li>Ability to work independently in ambiguous environments, follow through after launch, and document systems for others to operate.</li><li>Hands-on experience with REST APIs, Automated Testing, AI Evaluation, Workflow Automation, Experimentation, Data Quality, Monitoring, Cost Optimization.</li></ul><h3>Skills</h3><ul><li>GTM systems you’ve built and operated. You can show your contribution</li><li>the commercial result</li><li>what broke and how you fixed it. Hands-on engineering. You write Python or JavaScript</li><li>work with SQL</li><li>JavaScript</li><li>SQL</li><li>REST APIs</li><li>Webhooks</li><li>Git</li><li>Automated Testing</li><li>AI Evaluation</li><li>Workflow Automation</li><li>Experimentation</li><li>Commercial Analytics</li><li>LLMs</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><ul><li>Identify companies with relevant hiring signals by connecting market data, customer records, and Hiring OS activity.</li><li>Maintain reliable account information and determine whom to contact and when based on signals such as open roles and team expansion.</li><li>Build systems for account research, qualification, relevant outreach, and follow-up.</li><li>Use AI in outreach and research workflows with quality controls, clear human handoffs, and appropriate monitoring.</li><li>Build and maintain API integrations, webhooks, and workflow automations.</li><li>Handle failures, improve observability, and keep workflows reliable and easy to operate.</li><li>Protect customer and candidate information and manage API and execution costs.</li><li>Find bottlenecks, prioritize experiments, measure results, and stop ineffective approaches.</li><li>Turn successful experiments into repeatable systems that generate new and repeat hiring processes.</li><li>Establish performance baselines and track hiring processes started, conversion rates, cost per process, and workflow reliability.</li><li>Collaborate with Growth Owners and cross-functional teams to improve opportunity quality and commercial outcomes.</li><li>Document system decisions, tradeoffs, operating procedures, and results.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>US Technology Buyers</li><li>Hiring Platforms</li><li>Sales Operations</li><li>Recruiting Technology</li><li>Workflow Automation Tools</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><p>We provide the opportunity to participate in impactful and technically rigorous industrial data projects that drive innovation and professional growth. Our work environment emphasizes technical excellence, collaboration, and continuous innovation.</p><p>Niuro supports a 100% remote work model, allowing flexibility in work location globally. We invest in career development through ongoing training programs and leadership opportunities, ensuring continuous growth and success.</p><p>Upon successful completion of the initial contract, there is potential for long-term collaboration and stable, full-time employment, reflecting our long-term commitment to our team members.</p><p>Joining Niuro means becoming part of a global community dedicated to technological excellence and benefiting from a strong administrative support infrastructure that enables you to focus on impactful work without distraction.</p>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/gtm-engineer-niuro-remote-9639' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
