UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Senior SEO & UX Copywriter', descripcion=N'<h3>WHAT YOU''LL BRING</h3><div>4+ years writing for B2B SaaS, tech, or a specialized vertical, with a track record of driving organic search growth. </div><div>Working knowledge of technical SEO: semantic search, schema markup, internal linking, site architecture.</div><div> Real UX writing samples, not only long-form articles. Experience producing content that holds up in regulated or high-stakes categories. </div><div>High-level English, with sharp editing and grammar.</div><div> A portfolio with two or three live SEO case studies showing real traffic or ranking outcomes. </div><div>The self-direction to run a content program remotely without someone assigning you topics each week.</div><h3>Funciones</h3><div>Plan and write landing pages, conversion funnels, help center guides, and blog content for both AutoRaptor and TurboPT. </div><div>Run keyword and search intent research in Ahrefs, Semrush, and Google Search Console, and map topics to each stage of the B2B buyer journey. </div><div>Apply on-page SEO alongside newer answer-engine and generative-search practices, so our content shows up in featured snippets and AI-generated answers — not just blue links. </div><div>Write the microcopy: CTAs, navigation labels, form prompts, empty states, error messages. The small text that decides whether someone finishes a task or gives up. </div><div>Build credibility into the work with expert quotes, original data, customer case studies, and clear sourcing, in line with Google''s E-E-A-T and YMYL standards. </div><div>Partner with product, design, and growth on wireframes and technical SEO, so copy isn''t the last thing bolted on. </div><div>Own the numbers your work moves: non-branded organic traffic, keyword rankings, AI answer engine citations, and conversion rates on key pages.</div><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>Experience marketing to auto dealerships, physical therapy clinics, or another owner-operated small business audience.</li><li>Familiarity with healthcare content constraints — HIPAA, patient privacy, billing and claims terminology.</li><li>Comfort with basic HTML and CMS work, so you can ship your own page edits without waiting on a developer.</li><li>Track record of building content that earns links on its own: original research, data studies, tools, or calculators.</li><li>Experience running A/B tests on headlines, CTAs, or landing page copy and reading the results.</li><li>Familiarity with product analytics (GA4, Hotjar, Amplitude, or similar) to see where copy is losing people.</li><li>Have worked across two or more brands at once and can keep distinct voices straight.</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><div>Generous PTO<br>Budget for the tools you need — Ahrefs, Semrush, and whatever else makes the work better.</div>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/senior-seo-ux-copywriter-autoraptor-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
