UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Senior QA Engineer', descripcion=N'<h3>Experience and Skills</h3><ul><li>5+ years of experience in quality assurance, with a strong recent focus on test automation.</li><li>B2 English level or higher.</li><li>Proven, hands-on experience integrating and orchestrating AI agents or Model Context Protocols (MCPs) within active QA workflows.</li><li>Demonstrated experience utilizing low-code automation tools instead of relying solely on traditional code-heavy frameworks.</li><li>Strong background working closely with product and business stakeholders to define acceptance criteria and identify risks early in the development lifecycle.</li></ul><h3><h3>Skills</h3></h3><ul><li>QA Automation</li><li>AI Agent Orchestration</li><li>Low-Code Test Automation</li><li>Exploratory Testing</li><li>Test Case Design</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><p>Operating with high autonomy, you will support a robust development team of five to eight engineers, ensuring rapid delivery without compromising on quality. In this role, you will champion a modern approach to quality assurance by focusing on low-code automation tools rather than traditional, heavy code frameworks. You will act as a critical bridge between product, business, and engineering teams, identifying potential gaps in acceptance criteria early in the lifecycle and maintaining a seamless delivery pipeline.</p><ul><li>Design, implement, and maintain the overall test automation strategy utilizing low-code tools.</li><li>Orchestrate and supervise AI agents to generate and execute test cases, reviewing outputs to eliminate duplicate code, over-complicated logic, and false positives.</li><li>Perform targeted manual and exploratory testing as a validation step prior to automation.</li><li>Collaborate with product managers and developers during ticket creation to refine acceptance criteria and preemptively identify design or logic gaps.</li><li>Provide comprehensive quality support to a development team of 5 to 8+ engineers, communicating bugs, risks, and findings clearly and constructively.</li><li>Document testing methodologies, processes, and test cases to establish scalable quality standards.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>Angular</li><li>JMeter</li><li>Burp Suite</li><li>OWASP ZAP</li><li>Fintech</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><p>We provide the opportunity to participate in impactful and technically rigorous industrial data projects that drive innovation and professional growth. Our work environment emphasizes technical excellence, collaboration, and continuous innovation.</p><p>Niuro supports a 100% remote work model, allowing flexibility in work location globally. We invest in career development through ongoing training programs and leadership opportunities, ensuring continuous growth and success.</p><p>Upon successful completion of the initial contract, there is potential for long-term collaboration and stable, full-time employment, reflecting our long-term commitment to our team members.</p><p>Joining Niuro means becoming part of a global community dedicated to technological excellence and benefiting from a strong administrative support infrastructure that enables you to focus on impactful work without distraction.</p>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/senior-qa-engineer-niuro-remote-f141' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
