UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Growth Analyst: Paid Acquisition to Repeat Revenue', descripcion=N'<h3>This role is</h3><ul><li>Analytical and decision-driven: you explain why a number moved, not just what it did</li><li>Focused on revenue and customer quality, not clicks or lead counts</li><li>Hands-on: you use Claude daily against our live database to answer your own questions. Access is read-only, typically through an MCP connection.</li><li>Cross-functional across ads, funnel, messaging and lifecycle email</li></ul><p>This role is not</p><ul><li>A Google Ads button-pushing or media-buying job. You have run Google Ads accounts yourself, but your value is in the analysis.</li><li>Built on CTR, CPC or CPL as success metrics</li><li>A position where you report numbers someone else pulled</li><li>A fit if you rely on a CRM to verify conversions. We don''t use one, and our source of truth is our own database.</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><ol><li>Analyze Google Ads campaigns and keywords by downstream behavior: which ones drive one-time buyers and which drive repeat customers.</li><li>Run cohort analysis on signups: group customers by campaign and first-order behavior, then follow them to repeat orders and value.</li><li>Check that the conversions Google reports are real and carry the right value, and fix tracking when they aren''t.</li><li>Align ad messaging and landing pages with the customers we want to keep.</li><li>Connect acquisition source to lifecycle email in Customer.io: who orders once and doesn''t return.</li></ol><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>Experience running a self-serve funnel from first click to repeat purchase. Freemium, e-commerce, subscription and marketplace funnels all count.</li><li>Hands-on Google Ads experience and an understanding of conversion tracking and conversion value</li><li>A track record of tying paid acquisition to revenue or retention, with numbers</li><li>Comfort with imperfect data and with pushing back on assumptions</li><li>Daily use of Claude or similar tools, and you can say what they got wrong</li><li>Fluent spoken and written English (C1 or above) and based in Latin America</li><li>Interest in how AI search (GEO) changes acquisition (a plus, not required)</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><ul><li>Paid trial of 1-3 months, about 40 exclusive hours a week, with milestone-based pay and a 7-day termination notice</li><li>$4,000-4,500 per month, depending on experience</li><li>Strong overlap with US Eastern hours; the interviews are on camera</li><li>Conversion to a permanent role, through an employer of record, if the trial goes well</li></ul>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/growth-analyst-paid-acquisition-to-repeat-revenue-real-id-inc-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
