UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Outbound Sales Development Specialist', descripcion=N'<h3>What we’re looking for</h3><p>We’re seeking someone who can operate with initiative, structure, and follow-through—someone who understands how outbound prospecting turns into real business conversations. You’ll be comfortable working toward activity and pipeline goals while staying focused on quality and relevance.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Experience:</strong> Experience supporting sales teams, building pipelines, and driving qualified conversations with business decision-makers.</p></li><li><p><strong>Outbound skills:</strong> Hands-on experience executing multichannel outreach (email, LinkedIn, and phone) and iterating based on results.</p></li><li><p><strong>Research and targeting:</strong> Ability to research accounts and identify the right stakeholders efficiently and accurately.</p></li><li><p><strong>Communication:</strong> Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to tailor messaging for different prospect types.</p></li><li><p><strong>Tracking and improvement:</strong> Comfortable using outreach metrics to refine messaging, improve engagement, and increase conversion rates.</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaboration:</strong> You can work with sales stakeholders, take feedback, and translate it into practical changes to outreach and follow-up.</p></li><li><p><strong>Soft skills:</strong> Proactive mindset, persistence, attention to detail, and strong organizational habits. We also value professionalism and respect in all outreach efforts.</p></li></ul><p>If you enjoy turning research into action and want to help a growing cleaning company build a stronger sales pipeline, we’d like to hear from you.</p><h3>Funciones</h3><p>We’re looking for a proactive specialist to support outbound sales efforts for a growing cleaning company. In this role, our goal is to expand the pipeline with qualified conversations by running disciplined outreach and continuously improving performance.</p><ul><li><p>Research target accounts to build accurate lists of potential customers and prioritize prospects.</p></li><li><p>Identify decision-makers (and relevant influencers) within target organizations.</p></li><li><p>Execute outbound outreach campaigns across <strong>email</strong>, <strong>LinkedIn</strong>, and <strong>phone</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Develop and refine outreach messaging in collaboration with the sales team, improving clarity and relevance to business needs.</p></li><li><p>Track outreach activity and campaign results, using the insights to adjust targeting and messaging.</p></li><li><p>Refine lead qualification to drive more qualified, high-intent conversations.</p></li><li><p>Support conversion-rate improvement by reporting learnings, testing variations, and recommending process changes.</p></li><li><p>Maintain organized prospecting records to ensure follow-up is timely and consistent.</p></li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li><p>Experience working in a <strong>high-volume outbound</strong> environment where testing and iteration are key.</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with CRM and sales outreach workflows (for example: lead tracking, task follow-ups, and reporting).</p></li><li><p>Background in service industries (e.g., home services, commercial services, or field-based operations) where decision-makers value reliability and responsiveness.</p></li><li><p>Ability to craft multiple outreach angles (value propositions, use-case messaging, and pain-point messaging) for different segments.</p></li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><p>We’re building a team for a growing cleaning company. You’ll collaborate with sales stakeholders, receive feedback to improve outreach performance, and contribute directly to pipeline growth through your campaign execution and insights.</p>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/outbound-sales-development-specialist-calieluxe-cleaners-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
