UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Construction Virtual Assistant', descripcion=N'<h3>Experience and Additional Qualifications</h3><p>We’re looking for an organized, communicative Virtual Assistant who can represent Quali‑T professionally across multiple channels. You should be confident working independently, handling day-to-day requests, and applying sound judgment to solve problems quickly and accurately.</p><p><strong>Required experience and skills:</strong></p><ul><li>Proficiency with <strong>Google Sheets</strong> and <strong>Microsoft Excel</strong>, including spreadsheet management.</li><li>Strong <strong>email management</strong> skills and the ability to write clear, professional messages.</li><li>Experience or comfort with <strong>social media marketing</strong> tasks (supporting content and communication as assigned).</li><li>Excellent <strong>WhatsApp communication</strong>, including professional written communication and responsiveness.</li><li>Excellent verbal communication skills with a professional phone manner.</li><li>Ability to handle <strong>incoming</strong> and <strong>outgoing</strong> calls and conduct follow-ups.</li><li>Strong organizational skills, <strong>attention to detail</strong>, and effective <strong>time management</strong>.</li><li>Ability to work independently with minimal supervision while maintaining high quality.</li><li>Good judgment, common sense, initiative, and the ability to think critically and “outside the box”.</li></ul><p><strong>Professional communication expectations:</strong> We will expect you to communicate confidently with clients, internal team members, and vendors through WhatsApp and email, ensuring clarity, accuracy, and a positive experience.</p><p><strong>Nice to have:</strong> Prior experience in construction or roofing administration is a plus.</p><h3>Funciones</h3><p>We are seeking a proactive Virtual Assistant to support ongoing administration and communication for Quali‑T. In this role, we will rely on you to keep information organized, respond promptly, and coordinate follow-ups so our team can move faster with fewer interruptions.</p><ul><li>Manage data and reporting using <strong>Google Sheets</strong> and <strong>Microsoft Excel</strong>, including spreadsheet updates and routine checks.</li><li>Handle <strong>email management</strong>: triage inboxes, draft and respond to correspondence, and ensure messages are routed to the right person.</li><li>Support <strong>WhatsApp communication</strong> with clients, team members, and vendors, including clear written messaging and timely follow-ups.</li><li>Assist with <strong>social media marketing</strong> tasks, such as scheduling or preparing content (as assigned), and maintaining consistent communication.</li><li>Professionally manage <strong>incoming calls</strong> and conduct <strong>outgoing calls</strong> as needed, including call follow-ups and updates.</li><li>Use strong organizational skills to prioritize tasks, maintain accuracy, and meet deadlines with minimal supervision.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>Background or exposure to <strong>construction</strong> or <strong>roofing administration</strong>.</li><li>Experience supporting appointment scheduling, job tracking, or vendor/client coordination in an administrative capacity.</li><li>Comfort using multiple communication channels (email, calls, and WhatsApp) in a fast-paced environment.</li><li>Basic familiarity with social media content planning or engagement processes.</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><p><strong>Hours:</strong> Full Time.</p><p>We focus on clear communication, structured workflows, and dependable support for both clients and teams. If you enjoy organized, multi-channel coordination and want to contribute to smooth day-to-day operations at Quali‑T, we’d love to hear from you.</p>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/virtual-assistant-quali-t-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
DELETE e FROM dbo.cert_evidencia_v2 e JOIN dbo.fact_vacantes v ON v.vacante_id=e.vacante_id WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/virtual-assistant-quali-t-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Growth Specialist — Google Ads & SEO', descripcion=N'<h3>Qualifications and requirements</h3><p>Professional spoken and written English is required for client calls, campaign explanations, briefs, and long-form writing. You should communicate clearly and confidently in live conversations and produce accurate, original English copy. We assess clear, professional communication.</p><p>Bring hands-on experience across Google Ads, SEO, lead generation, landing pages, and conversion tracking. Strong original writing, careful documentation, and the ability to manage several client accounts are essential.</p><p>This is a 40-hour-per-week contractor role and must be your only full-time job. You can organize your day around agreed client and team commitments while meeting deadlines and availability requirements. Track client work in Staff App and payroll time in Trackabi.</p><h3>Funciones</h3><p>• Optimize Google Ads campaigns for conversion performance, qualified leads, and return.</p><p>• Develop keyword strategies and improve on-page SEO, content, and website search visibility.</p><p>• Write original English blog posts, landing pages, and campaign copy for each client’s audience and commercial goals.</p><p>• Plan low-fidelity website and landing-page wireframes before design and development.</p><p>• Use WhatConverts, Ahrefs, Google Analytics, and campaign data to track conversions, lead quality, rankings, and profitability.</p><p>• Communicate through Slack, maintain tasks in Staff App, and report progress weekly.</p><p>• Recommend improvements, record Loom walkthroughs, and document useful processes.</p><p>Success means meeting deadlines, producing useful work for the time spent, and improving client outcomes.</p><h3>Deseable</h3><p>Familiarity with WhatConverts, Ahrefs, Google Analytics, Loom, and documented remote workflows is helpful.</p><h3>Beneficios</h3><p>Salary: USD 950–1,400 per month before tax (approximately MXN 17,500–25,900). Negotiable based on experience and demonstrated value. The MXN equivalent is approximate and may vary with exchange rates.</p><p>• Fully remote; 40 hours per week around agreed client and team commitments.</p><p>• Performance and referral bonuses.</p><p>• Healthcare support after six months, using a provider in your country.</p><p>• Paid time off starting at five days per year and increasing with tenure, paid birthday leave, and Christmas and New Year company holidays.</p><p>• Weekly coaching, quarterly training, and one-to-one mentorship.</p><p>Apply through Get on Board. Please submit your application in English.</p>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/growth-specialist-google-ads-seo-jrr-marketing-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
