UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Senior Business Development Representative (Sbdr)', descripcion=N'<h3>Qualifications and requirements</h3><ul><li><strong>3–6+ years of experience</strong> in B2B Business Development, SDR/BDR, Inside Sales, or outbound sales.</li><li>Proven experience in <strong>cold calling, outbound prospecting, lead qualification, and appointment setting</strong>.</li><li>Experience selling <strong>staffing, recruitment, outsourcing, BPO, workforce solutions, professional services, or other B2B services</strong> is strongly preferred.</li><li>Proven ability to engage <strong>Founders, Owners, C-Suite executives, HR leaders, Operations leaders, and other senior decision-makers</strong>.</li><li>Strong <strong>cold-calling, objection-handling, prospecting, qualification, and relationship-building skills</strong>.</li><li>Experience with <strong>LinkedIn Sales Navigator, prospecting platforms, and CRM systems</strong> such as HubSpot, Salesforce, or Zoho.</li><li>Strong account research and personalized outreach capabilities.</li><li>Excellent written and verbal English communication skills, with confidence communicating with US-based prospects.</li><li>Ability to independently manage a high-volume outbound pipeline and consistently generate qualified sales opportunities.</li><li>Experience prospecting within <strong>Healthcare, Legal, Finance, or other US service-based industries</strong> is an advantage.</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><p>The <strong>Senior Business Development Representative (SBDR)</strong> is responsible for generating qualified sales opportunities for CrewBloom’s <strong>remote staffing solutions</strong> through strategic B2B outbound prospecting.</p><p>The role focuses on identifying and engaging US-based companies that can benefit from building and scaling remote teams, particularly across <strong>Healthcare, Legal, Finance, and other service-based industries</strong>. The SBDR will connect with business owners, executives, and other key decision-makers, understand their staffing needs, and convert qualified conversations into Discovery Calls.</p><p>This is a <strong>hunter-style role</strong> requiring strong cold-calling skills, independent prospecting, personalized outreach, and the ability to confidently communicate the business value of remote staffing.</p><p><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></p><ul><li>Identify and prospect US-based companies that could benefit from <strong>remote staffing and workforce solutions</strong>.</li><li>Generate qualified opportunities through <strong>cold calling, email outreach, LinkedIn, and other outbound channels</strong>.</li><li>Engage <strong>Founders, Owners, C-Suite executives, VPs, Directors, HR leaders, Operations leaders, and other hiring decision-makers</strong>.</li><li>Understand prospects’ hiring challenges, staffing requirements, operational needs, and potential opportunities for remote talent.</li><li>Clearly communicate CrewBloom’s value proposition and how remote staffing can support <strong>cost efficiency, scalability, and business growth</strong>.</li><li>Personalize outreach based on the prospect’s company, industry, hiring activity, and potential workforce needs.</li><li>Qualify prospects, handle initial objections, and determine fit before scheduling Discovery Calls.</li><li>Maintain accurate prospecting activities, follow-ups, and pipeline information in the CRM.</li><li>Consistently build a high-quality pipeline while balancing outreach volume with personalization and relevance.</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><h3>Beneficios</h3><ul><li><strong>Join Our Dynamic Team:</strong> Experience our fun, inclusive, innovative culture that values your unique contributions and supports your professional growth.</li><li><strong>Embrace the Opportunities:</strong> Seize daily chances to learn, innovate, and excel. Make a real impact in your field.</li><li><strong>Limitless Career Growth:</strong> Unlock a world of possibilities and resources to propel your career forward.</li><li><strong>Fast-Paced Thrills:</strong> Thrive in a high-energy, engaging atmosphere. Embrace challenges and reap stimulating rewards.</li><li><strong>Flexibility, Your Way:</strong> Embrace the freedom to work from home or any location of your choice. Create your ideal work environment.</li><li><strong>Work-Life Balance at Its Best: </strong>Say goodbye to stressful commutes and hello to quality time with loved ones. Achieve a healthy work-life integration to perform at your best.</li></ul>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/senior-business-development-representative-sbdr-crewbloom-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
