UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Head of Engineering [with CTO Path]', descripcion=N'<h3>Key Responsibilities</h3><p><strong>You must be able to:</strong></p><ul><li>Explain root causes vs surface symptoms clearly.</li><li>Recommend exactly how to tackle our<strong> tech-stack </strong>limitations in the most agile &amp; lean way possible.</li><li>Create a 90-day execution plan that aligns technical realities with business goals</li></ul><p><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></p><p><strong>Technical leadership (You set the standard)</strong></p><ul><li>Own technical direction for the client-area/tech-stack decoupling (architecture, interfaces, incremental migration plan)</li><li>Establish engineering best practices: code quality, reviews, testing strategy, definition of done</li><li>Make pragmatic tradeoffs that maximize learning + delivery speed without creating future traps</li><li>Implement AI in the tech team throughout the full development cycle to speed up development time</li></ul><p><strong>Delivery &amp; Planning (You make execution predictable)</strong></p><ul><li>Translate product goals into an execution plan: milestones, sequencing, risks, and dependencies</li><li>Break down initiatives into tasks the team can execute independently</li><li>Track progress with lightweight, real KPIs (delivery, quality, reliability), and communicate status clearly</li></ul><p><strong>Team Leadership (You level up the team)</strong></p><ul><li>Mentor developers through feedback and coaching</li><li>Run effective 1:1s and create clarity on expectations and growth</li><li>Raise the bar for structured thinking and ownership across the team</li><li>Serve as a technical leader, combining hands-on development with strategic oversight.</li></ul><p><strong>Hands-on engineering (You ship)</strong></p><ul><li>Implement critical parts of the new client area + middleware layer</li><li>Review PRs, improve legacy code safely, and guide refactors</li><li>Help the team move faster through better tooling and patterns (including AI-assisted workflows while maintaining quality)</li></ul><p><strong>Helping Product Outcomes</strong></p><ul><li>Be involved in defining the product roadmap &amp; team expectations &amp; help us take the right decisions to build what the customer needs.</li><li>Be involved with ICP interviews, customer discovery, translate insights into product &amp; tech priorities, and validate value delivered.</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><p>As a Head of Engineering you will be leading our engineering team as we <strong>decouple our legacy customer area (WHMCS / PHP) into a modern web app.</strong></p><p>This is a <strong>hands-on technical leadership role</strong>: You’ll write code most days, guide architecture and execution, and be the single engineering counterpart to the PM/CEO to translate product requirements into a clear, deliverable plan.</p><p><strong>Hands-on vs leadership</strong></p><p>Expect roughly <strong>50% hands-on engineering (</strong>coding, architecture, code reviews) and <strong>50% leadership </strong>(planning, mentorship, delivery accountability) — typical for a small team environment.</p><p><strong>Reporting</strong></p><p>You’ll work closely with the CEO/PM (and collaborate with the rest of the engineering team).</p><p><strong>Your First Mission: Diagnosis (First 30 Days)</strong></p><p>In your first 30 days, you will be in diagnosis mode. You’ll perform a <strong>deep technical + product diagnosis </strong>of our end-to-end — Tech-stack evaluation, WHMCS dependencies, billing flows, and internal tooling &amp; customer needs.</p><h3>Deseable</h3><p><strong>Hard skills:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Deep Technical Skills: </strong>Help you bridge the gap between developers &amp; product</li><li><strong>AI + Coding: </strong>Leverage AI tools for fast iteration while maintaining high quality</li><li><strong>System Thinking: </strong>Understand how complex technical systems fit together</li><li><strong>Business Understanding: </strong>Understand the business side of things when being involved in tech/product decisions</li><li><strong>Excellent Communication: </strong>Ask smart questions early and surface risks before they become outages</li></ul><p><strong>Personality traits:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Start-up Mentality: </strong>Love working in a fast-paced environment</li><li><strong>Hands-on approach: </strong>Ready to roll up your sleeves &amp; delve deep into details</li><li><strong>Customer First Mentality: </strong>Understand customer pains, use cases, and workflows</li><li><strong>Results Oriented: </strong>Take full responsibility for outcomes</li><li><strong>Product-minded: </strong>Understand that engineering need to deliver business outcomes</li></ul><p><strong>Career background:</strong></p><ul><li>7+ yrs of hands-on software engineering experience</li><li>3+ yrs of team leadership experience</li><li>2+ yrs of experience in a<strong> broader business/product involvement</strong></li><li>Fluent English</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><ul><li><strong>100% Remote Work: </strong>Enjoy the flexibility of working 100% remotely from the comfort of your home or any location worldwide.</li><li><strong>Professional Growth: </strong>As we are a small company, you''ll have the chance to engage with various aspects of the business, fostering your professional development.</li><li><strong>Mentorship &amp; time with the CEO: </strong>You’ll get the chance to work closely 1 on 1 with the CEO &amp; Founder of the company &amp; receive direct coaching &amp; help from a proven leader &amp; entrepreneur.</li><li><strong>Shape the next phase of RapidSeedbox: </strong>You’ll be joining at a pivotal stage, where your ideas can genuinely influence our product and shape the product strategy.</li><li><strong>Friendly Environment: </strong>Work in a supportive and friendly environment where collaboration, respect, and positivity are part of every day.</li><li><strong>Emergency Fund: </strong>We offer an interest-free emergency fund with comfortable payouts to help you in times of need.</li><li><strong>Paid Time Off: </strong>Take as many paid time-offs as you need to ensure you are well-rested and ready to tackle new challenges.</li></ul>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/head-of-engineering-with-cto-path-rapidseedbox-llc-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
