UPDATE dbo.fact_vacantes SET titulo=N'Founding Growth Marketing & Customer Success Lead', descripcion=N'<h3>What we’re looking for</h3><div>We are hiring a self-driven, AI-savvy operator to help build the company’s go-to-market engine and customer experience from the ground up. This is a broad, hands-on founding role for someone who can move fluidly across marketing, customer success, operations, and special projects.</div><div>This person will help us generate demand, support prospects and customers, improve onboarding and retention, build scalable workflows using AI, and lead high-priority projects that are critical to company growth. Core requirements are:</div><ul><li>At least three years experience at a top-tier company or at a startup</li><li>Experience in at least one of: growth marketing, customer success, GTM ops, founder’s associate / startup operator, or a similarly broad startup role</li><li>Strong written and spoken English</li><li>Strong interpersonal skills and good customer presence</li><li>AI-native or highly AI-savvy; uses AI tools in day-to-day work and can explain how </li><li>Comfortable switching between strategy and execution</li><li>Highly organized and reliable</li><li>Good judgment in ambiguous situations</li><li>Strong follow-through</li><li>Excited by early-stage startup environments</li></ul><div><strong>This role is a fit if...</strong></div><ul><li>You like variety, ownership, and fast learning</li><li>You are energized by helping both customers and the business grow</li><li>You can write clearly, think commercially, and execute quickly</li><li>You do not need heavy structure to do great work</li></ul><div><strong>This role is not a fit if...</strong></div><ul><li>You want a narrowly defined specialist role</li><li>You dislike customer interaction</li><li>You rely on clear structure and detailed direction</li><li>You are not comfortable working independently and solving open-ended problems</li><li>You are not excited about using AI as part of your daily workflow</li></ul><h3>Funciones</h3><div><strong>This role exists to drive four outcomes:</strong></div><ul><li>Generate and nurture qualified sales pipeline</li><li>Build AI-enabled GTM and customer workflows that that help scale the company</li><li>Deliver an excellent customer experience from first touch through onboarding and ongoing success</li><li>Lead special projects that materially improve growth, execution, and customer outcomes</li></ul><div><strong>Responsibilities</strong></div><div>Growth / marketing: run and improve outbound, inbound, content, and lifecycle marketing initiatives, including</div><ul><li>Create and deploy marketing assets, customer-facing copy, sales enablement materials, case studies, and follow-up sequences</li><li>Help test positioning, messaging, channels, and growth experiments</li><li>Track campaign performance and turn insights into next actions</li><li>Support founder-led sales and GTM execution</li></ul><div>Customer success: own or support sales onboarding, training, follow-up, and day-to-day customer communication, including</div><ul><li>Ensure customers are progressing, getting value, and staying engaged</li><li>Identify and develop systemic improvements from customer pain points, objections, and product feedback</li><li>Help improve retention, expansion, and customer satisfaction</li><li>Create scalable customer playbooks, templates, processes, and automations AI-enabled operations: spearhead the deployment of AI tools to drive workflow efficiency and scale across Sales &amp; Marketing</li></ul><div>Use AI tools aggressively and intelligently to improve company processes</div><ul><li>Build and maintain workflows for prospecting, research, outreach, reporting, onboarding, and support</li><li>Identify repetitive work that should be automated and implement practical solutions</li><li>Help the team develop better habits around AI-assisted execution</li></ul><div><strong>Special projects: lead special projects that are important to company growth, customer success, or internal effectiveness</strong></div><div><strong>General founding-team contribution</strong></div><ul><li>Work directly with the founders on high-priority opportunities</li><li>Operate with urgency, judgment, and ownership</li><li>Help shape the company’s early culture, systems, and standards</li></ul><h3>Deseable</h3><ul><li>Experience working with U.S. customers</li><li>Experience in SaaS, recruiting, HR tech, or SMB software</li><li>Experience with CRM, email automation, support tools, analytics, and no-code / workflow tools</li><li>Experience creating customer-facing content or running lightweight growth experiments</li><li>Experience coordinating cross-functional projects</li></ul><h3>Beneficios</h3><div>This role offers performance bonus and equity participation contingent on performance.</div>' WHERE url_vacante=N'https://www.getonbrd.com/jobs/founding-growth-marketing-customer-success-lead-verahire-remote' AND fuente_id IN (SELECT fuente_id FROM dbo.dim_fuente WHERE nombre='GetOnBoard');
